COMP 2404 B2 - Assignment #3
Name: Mohamed Azab 101331588

Purpose:
  Manage a telephone company's text messages and subscribers, display the
  chronological message list, display messages for each subscriber, and
  rank subscribers by their messaging activity.

Source files:
  main.cc Control.cc View.cc Time.cc Date.cc Subscriber.cc SubArray.cc
  Msg.cc ExternMsg.cc InternMsg.cc MsgList.cc Telco.cc

Header files:
  Control.h View.h Time.h Date.h Subscriber.h SubArray.h Msg.h
  ExternMsg.h InternMsg.h MsgList.h Telco.h defs.h

Compilation (on the COMP 2404 Ubuntu VM):
  make

Run:
  ./a3

Clean compilation artifacts:
  make clean

Command-line arguments: None.

Menu:
  1 - Print all messages
  2 - Print all subscribers
  3 - Print subscribers by activity
  0 - Exit
